The description of r_56 is "[steamy dish-pit part 0]".

The r_57 is mapped south of r_56.
The r_55 is mapped north of r_56.
Understand "still workshop" as r_70.
The internal name of r_70 is "still workshop".
The printed name of r_70 is "-= Still Workshop =-".
The still workshop part 0 is some text that varies. The still workshop part 0 is "Guess what, you are in the place we're calling the still workshop. Let's see what's in here.



There is an unguarded exit to the north. You need an unblocked exit? You should try going south.".
The description of r_70 is "[still workshop part 0]".

The r_71 is mapped south of r_70.
The r_69 is mapped north of r_70.
Understand "ugly spare room" as r_79.
The internal name of r_79 is "ugly spare room".
The printed name of r_79 is "-= Ugly Spare Room =-".
The ugly spare room part 0 is some text that varies. The ugly spare room part 0 is "You arrive in a spare room. An ugly kind of place.



There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unblocked. There is an unguarded exit to the south.".
The description of r_79 is "[ugly spare room part 0]".

The r_78 is mapped south of r_79.
The r_80 is mapped north of r_79.
Understand "stuffed spare room" as r_80.
The internal name of r_80 is "stuffed spare room".
The printed name of r_80 is "-= Stuffed Spare Room =-".
The stuffed spare room part 0 is some text that varies. The stuffed spare room part 0 is "You make a grand eccentric entrance into a stuffed spare room.



There is an unguarded exit to the north. There is an exit to the south. Don't worry, it is unguarded.".
The description of r_80 is "[stuffed spare room part 0]".

The r_79 is mapped south of r_80.
The r_81 is mapped north of r_80.
Understand "still study 0" as r_90.
The internal name of r_90 is "still study 0".
The printed name of r_90 is "-= Still Study 0 =-".
The still study 0 part 0 is some text that varies. The still study 0 part 0 is "You are in a study 0. A still one.



You need an unblocked exit? You should try going north. You need an unguarded exit? You should try going south.".
